<p>EDIT: I wrote this whilst sleep deprived. Therefore, I read &quot;matter and energy from nothing&quot; and immediately thought &quot;cake.&quot; However, I have to acknowledge that this simply isn't the case, because these don't reproduce quickly enough and have no defenses against predators. They have to live as pets and lab animals because they would never survive without people helping them.</p>
<p>Downvote neutralized. Will change to up if it's made clear that only personnel living on site can keep them, and restrictions are made obvious.</p>
